[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Copy %%ETCDIR%%/continuwuity.toml.sample to %%ETCDIR%%/continuwuity.toml and
set at least server_name before starting the service.  The database is kept
in /var/db/continuwuity.

The first account has to be registered with the single-use token the server
writes to its log on startup.  A registration_token set in the configuration
file only takes effect once that first account exists.

Continuwuity speaks plain HTTP and expects a reverse proxy in front of it for
TLS and for serving the .well-known delegation of your domain.
EOM
}
]
